ESP32 downstream integration (local modifications, 2026-10-14)
------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored from https://github.com/unravelaidk/unravel-agent-runtime,
revision c507d6b2b2514527a572b0d2331aef34961ba652,
source subtree crates/unravel-agent-runtime/src.

This downstream copy is modified. Its standalone Cargo manifest omits desktop
Tokio features. Local tool/orchestrator/export changes carry real provider call
identity, owning execution identity, deadline/cancellation context and explicit
tool result states, including unknown outcomes. AgentLoop has a synchronous
checkpoint hook before requests and between its public turn iterations for
the embedded archive/complete-group compaction bridge.

